+"""
+Substitution controller enforces staged autonomy for player substitution actions.
+Substitution is treated as high-risk and defaults to require A2A (human approval).
+When verifier returns "recommend", a prefilled A2A request is opened for coach/medical approval.
+If ensemble returns "auto" AND action_low_risk is True (rare for substitutions), an automatic substitution may proceed.
+All actions produce a KMS-signed receipt (stubbed) and are recorded in local sqlite for audit.
