+# Operator notes: Substitution/autonomy, privacy, drift & connectivity mitigations
+
+This patch implements the following mitigations:
+
+- False positives / substitution safety:
+  - Ensemble verifier (services/verifier/ensemble_verifier.py) with conservative calibration and thresholds.
+  - Substitution controller (services/staged_autonomy/substitution_controller.py) enforces A2A for substitution decisions and only allows auto-execute when explicitly low-risk.
+
+- Privacy & takedown:
+  - Presidio wrapper (services/privacy/presidio_wrapper.py) redacts at ingest, stores redacted artifact and (stub) encrypts original.
+  - Retrieval guard (services/privacy/retrieval_guard.py) checks A2A approval before returning originals.
+  - Takedown API (services/privacy/takedown_api.py) to request takedown and mark artifacts for operator removal.
+  - A takedown test is provided in services/privacy/takedown_test.sh (not part of patch content).
+
+- Overreliance / staged autonomy:
+  - substitution_controller uses staged_autonomy patterns: recommend -> prefilled A2A, require human approval for high-risk decisions.
+
+- Model drift & retraining:
+  - Drift detector and cronjobs (services/monitoring/drift_detector.py, k8s/monitoring/drift-detector-cronjob.yaml).
+  - Weekly retrain CronJob scaffold (k8s/cron/retrain-weekly.yaml).
+  - Drift detector triggers MCP events so operators can review and open A2A if needed.
+
+- Connectivity & edge:
+  - Fetchtoken service for offline approvals at edge (services/edge/fetchtoken.py).
+  - Milvus sync agent deployment for edge -> central sync (k8s/edge/milvus-sync-deployment.yaml).
+
+Operator actions before production:
+- Replace all stub implementations (encryption, object-store writes, KMS signing) with your cloud/Vault/KMS integrations.
+- Deploy Gatekeeper and run in audit mode for 48–72h for any policy additions.
+- Populate A2A API endpoints and ensure approver service is HA and authenticated.
+- Install Presidio adapter image and configure its models for PII types you want redacted.
+- Configure milvus-sync agent with credentials to central Milvus and secure the sync channel.
+- Validate retrain CronJob triggers appropriate Argo workflows and that MLflow artifacts are recorded and signed.
+
